        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Usiya was sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaloat fuga sean bea Yuda, nea abeeda gaba gweanyeew damalah, ak geembiit ghoah sugoocheanda goopteadawa hoorgeeda ghwaan was Amasiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwadeas Eloti, ak goodeelsa heeda fuga Yuda, damanda meawa sugoocheanda gida meawda ghweanigaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usiya abeeda gaba gweanyeew damalah damanda ang'eada gheambalmeedean, hean goombaliischi gweanyeew haradam ea damaniyeenya aba Yerusalemu. Nea gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Yekoliya bea ng'eanyiida Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin ng'asheega doobiiweadi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji gida ghayi sin Amasiyaheeda was ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinaada ak gagaseada NG'UTAMIIDA damanda eawoojiga Sakariya, was dea ghayi anaal niny giiwalda gheang'da ASEETA; hean iisinyooh gagaseada NG'UTAMIIDA, ghwanung' ASEETA ghwanyas uurda niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwarita gawa gang'uchi sea fuga Filisti, ak gwanyarja ghamarda Gati ea dea Yabne ea dea Ashdodi; ak ghwadeas mujiinajeega aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Ashdodi ea bugusta fuga Filisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaweat ASEETA niny aba badahuuka fuga Filisti, ea gea Arabu abiita Gurbaali, ea aba badayda fuga Meuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoadaw fuga Amoni gwaadi heeda Usiya, hean gageawiit iitaanyi ea ghwahita moonghajeega ng'eanyiida Misri, aba gideaba ninyas uurda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwadeas Usiya madalajeega aba Yerusalemu aba gidaghuuta heeda ghwan geaw, ea aba gidaghuuta moangoachi ea aba heeda ghwan geaw ak gooneaweesa hilooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwadeas madalajeega aba dareapcheeda, ak ghaghurghur healatka saang'a aba gideaba gwandeawa hawanda saang'a bea dugwa, aba Shefela ea aba mooheeda, nea gwandeawa fuga barooda ea gea jea gang'ula madameega misabiibu aba iheenga heayeeniga ea aba ng'eanyiida miy sigeeda, aba gideaba niny ghabwariiy barooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gicha Usiya gwandeawa lugooda shirikara bea ng'ucheeda, nea silajaada bugusta aba giteena mooneeda nyaawa gadiyeeda sin Yeieliheeda was ng'oorshoocheanda ea siida haw was Maaseya nea saawa gamiineadaysa siida siguura Hananiya, bea shirikareeda hees bea sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mooneeda fuga gealga ghweaniga was fuga meanyi bea ng'ucheeda ea sagalamnyooji iyeenya gil ea bughalaji lah (2600). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea hing'eadayda nyaawa gwanda shirikaraji sagalamnyooji samwagu ea ispwa ea bughalaji muut (307500), was fuga ammu gang'uchi aba uurda haw, ghaweat sugoocheanda aba badayda weajoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasissa Usiya shirikareadaanyi igeambooniga, ea ng'utkeaka, ea ngoofajeega, ea hang'weaka ng'ucheeda, ea ghuweang'da ea geatka, ea lagheanga jea eefutiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin dabita ng'ucheeda aba Yerusalemu, nea ghwanung' gwasin gearnoodiga, ak geanung' goobiida iheenga madaloojiga ea ghwanuutka ghamarda jea eejakiideawa geatka ea lagheanga hees. Hean gageawiit iitaanyi, aba gideaba geaweat muuchi, bwak ea ghwanyas uurda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Usiya gealas aba ghwarjeadaanyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwanyas uurda hean ghang'ut ghwarjeeda, ak ghoah giibeedeaydaanyi. Aba gideaba gwasissa munyinda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI, aba gideaba gawa jeeda gheeda sibata NG'UTAMIIDA ghaghwarda geediga ng'andidi aba heeda wagiida bea geediga ng'andidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaat geeshtaanyi ashoohoocheanda siguura Asariya, sea ashoohoodi seedam bea NG'UTAMIIDA was fuga meanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata ghoadeal sugoocheanda was Usiya, ak gwayeesha, “Gadiyeani mabeaynyi, Ea Usiya, gwardeaysiinda NG'UTAMIIDA geediga ng'andidi, gadiyeani gaba ashoohoodiga was orjooga Haruni, was gea ghayi siikghaydiit gagwariida geediga ng'andidi. Riteawana hiji ghaydidiin; aba gideaba nisini ramaseanda, ak ea maynyasa mureeda aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwanyareas Usiya. Nea abeeda gwandeawa gida sigwariideawa geediga ng'andidi aba geatingaaschi, hean nea gwanyareeksa ashoohoodiga hean gwarina gheamamdaanyi udamusuura, aba madeeda ashoohoodiga aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, murdeeda heeda wagiida sigwariideaysa geediga ng'andidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Asariya was ashoohoocheanda haw, sea ashoohoodiga sean gang'ula niny, ak ging'ulayi, ning'ut gheamamdaanyi udamusuura! Hean gealamwach eeruuta jarooda aba damandida, ak eara niny ghwalamwach gwarita aba gideaba nilas NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea sugoocheanda was Usiya gabearji udamusuura ea gagul damanda miyeadaanyi, ak geasachi goobiida jeedeaba gheanyi nea gaba geawi aba gideaba gabearji udamusuura, aba gideaba siing'aamwa jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. Ak orjeedaanyi siguura Yotam geanung' gamiineadaysa gheeda sugoocheanda, nea ghoahaaghwa buuneeda ea ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gadiyoojiga siipuut bea Usiya, gidang'eada gea madeeda ea gagul gea huuydeanda, ghang'oar sibaneeda siguura Isaya was orjeeda Amosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwaluudayi Usiya sea ghweanigaaschi, ak geebuy sea ghweanigaaschi aba jeeda madamnyeanda sugoodiga, aba gideaba gwayi saawa, “Niny gabearji udamusuura.” Ak goombaliischi Yotam was orjeedaanyi aba hoorgeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
